WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.920
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:32.133 --> 01:33.426
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.510 --> 01:34.928
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:38.139 --> 01:40.850
<i>That outbuilding will soon be demolished.</i>

01:41.810 --> 01:44.187
So I would like you to investigate
before that happens.

01:44.270 --> 01:46.606
The curse that Lady Anshi spoke of.

01:47.315 --> 01:51.444
The reason the late emperor's body
remained unchanged from when he was alive.

01:51.528 --> 01:53.196
That is what I want you to uncover.

01:55.406 --> 01:57.951
<i>It has been six years</i>
<i>since the late emperor passed.</i>

01:58.034 --> 02:02.664
<i>Once that outbuilding is gone, only</i>
<i>his tomb will remain to remind us of him.</i>

02:03.248 --> 02:07.085
<i>If the mystery remains unsolved,</i>
<i>Lady Anshi's heart will never be at peace.</i>

02:07.710 --> 02:11.256
Understood. However, I have one request.

02:11.339 --> 02:12.590
A request?

02:12.674 --> 02:14.843
May I enter the room

02:14.926 --> 02:17.470
where the late emperor once resided?

02:19.222 --> 02:20.932
You will have permission.

02:23.810 --> 02:26.479
<i>It is said that</i>
<i>the emperor's consent is required,</i>

02:26.563 --> 02:30.024
<i>but if the Empress Dowager intervenes,</i>
<i>there should be no issue.</i>

02:30.108 --> 02:34.362
Maomao, your bed is ready.

02:34.445 --> 02:36.990
Thank you very much, Lady Suiren.

02:37.073 --> 02:38.783
Thank you for lending me a room.

02:38.867 --> 02:40.910
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

02:41.703 --> 02:43.913
<i>Surprisingly, she has rather cute taste.</i>

02:43.997 --> 02:45.874
The couch would have been fine.

02:45.957 --> 02:50.628
I can't let you do that. It's been a while
since you've been in this wing.

02:50.712 --> 02:52.630
Please rest well.

02:53.214 --> 02:54.090
Yes.

02:54.966 --> 02:58.136
<i>Lately, I've always been</i>
<i>at the Jade Pavilion.</i>

02:58.219 --> 03:01.139
<i>Honestly, I'm relieved</i>
<i>I don't have to go back tonight.</i>

03:01.764 --> 03:05.310
<i>I wonder how Lady Hongniang</i>
<i>would have reacted if I had seen her.</i>

03:05.393 --> 03:08.146
<i>Actually, I've been</i>
<i>getting off easy until now.</i>

03:08.688 --> 03:10.899
<i>An attendant who doesn't</i>
<i>belong to any specific palace</i>

03:10.982 --> 03:13.735
<i>and shows up in other palaces…</i>

03:13.818 --> 03:16.905
<i>That's not something the palace women</i>
<i>would find acceptable.</i>

03:21.784 --> 03:25.955
<i>Sometimes, I don't even understand</i>
<i>my own position.</i>

03:27.874 --> 03:30.460
<i>Reading next to candlelight…</i>
<i>how luxurious.</i>

03:31.544 --> 03:36.424
Do you want to read something, Maomao?
You can go look in the back room.

03:39.761 --> 03:41.179
<i>Books are precious.</i>

03:41.262 --> 03:43.765
<i>I should read whenever I get the chance.</i>

03:43.848 --> 03:46.226
<i>I hope there's something</i>
<i>that suits my taste.</i>

03:47.518 --> 03:49.395
Wait for me!

03:50.939 --> 03:53.566
<i>Lady Suiren, you're actually quite young.</i>

03:59.697 --> 04:00.698
Are you curious about that?

04:01.282 --> 04:04.202
Rest assured.
I have no intention of stealing anything!

04:04.285 --> 04:05.703
I know that.

04:07.622 --> 04:09.332
Is this a child's toy?

04:09.415 --> 04:13.461
Yes, they were Lord Jinshi's favorites.

04:13.544 --> 04:16.297
Maomao, what do you think of Lord Jinshi?

04:16.381 --> 04:17.507
Huh?

04:17.590 --> 04:19.342
I think he's a good superior.

04:20.051 --> 04:22.095
<i>Mainly because he gives me rare medicines.</i>

04:22.679 --> 04:24.764
Is there some hidden meaning in that?

04:25.765 --> 04:26.933
Well, never mind.

04:27.433 --> 04:29.352
Because he always
wanted to play with this one,

04:29.435 --> 04:32.814
I secretly hid it from him.

04:32.897 --> 04:37.068
But when I did, he cried uncontrollably.

04:38.778 --> 04:40.571
There are other toys, you know.

04:40.655 --> 04:42.991
No! I want that one!

04:43.074 --> 04:45.576
Only that one will do!

04:46.577 --> 04:49.080
<i>Gaoshun struggled</i>

04:49.163 --> 04:52.959
to find a new toy
that would stop him from crying.

04:53.042 --> 04:54.585
Why did you take it away?

04:55.211 --> 04:59.299
When someone becomes too attached to
one thing, they can't see anything else.

05:00.049 --> 05:03.803
<i>He wasn't born into a position</i>
<i>where that was allowed.</i>

05:04.429 --> 05:08.599
Whether he liked it or not,
he had to grow up quickly and act mature.

05:09.267 --> 05:13.104
That was his mother's wish.

05:14.063 --> 05:15.398
<i>His mother's…</i>

05:16.065 --> 05:20.111
<i>I've heard that growing up in a repressive</i>
<i>environment can affect the heart.</i>

05:21.070 --> 05:24.073
<i>Gradually, he began</i>
<i>to show his childish side.</i>

05:24.824 --> 05:28.119
<i>That too must be a part of</i>
<i>Lord Jinshi's true nature.</i>

05:29.370 --> 05:32.957
<i>And yet, those around him</i>
<i>treat him as the beautiful eunuch.</i>

05:33.041 --> 05:34.667
<i>It's strange, isn't it?</i>

05:40.423 --> 05:41.424
This painting…

05:41.507 --> 05:43.676
Oh, what's this doing here?

05:44.719 --> 05:46.804
I was told to throw it away.

05:47.472 --> 05:48.848
<i>What was it?</i>

05:50.641 --> 05:52.185
May I touch this?

05:53.561 --> 05:54.729
Go ahead.

06:00.943 --> 06:02.779
It's just a small stone.

06:02.862 --> 06:05.740
I wonder where he picked it up from.

06:05.823 --> 06:07.742
Did you take it away from him immediately?

06:07.825 --> 06:11.370
Yes, a random stone
isn't exactly clean, is it?

06:12.121 --> 06:13.372
That was the right call.

06:15.541 --> 06:16.501
It's poisonous.

06:17.085 --> 06:18.294
What do you mean?

06:18.377 --> 06:22.548
That's what I'd like to ask.
Why was something like this lying around?

06:27.470 --> 06:31.140
Did Lord Jinshi ever enter
the inner court as a child?

06:31.224 --> 06:32.100
Yes,

06:32.183 --> 06:34.227
occasionally…

06:34.310 --> 06:37.146
But why does that matter?

06:37.230 --> 06:38.898
I can't say anything for now…

06:39.649 --> 06:43.402
<i>I have a theory. But no proof yet.</i>

06:44.278 --> 06:48.366
Lady Suiren, by tomorrow,
the Empress Dowager's so-called curse

06:49.033 --> 06:52.370
and the reason why the late emperor's body
didn't decay will become clear.

06:52.954 --> 06:55.248
Can you wait until then?

07:00.962 --> 07:03.381
<i>Even Lord Jinshi is involved now.</i>

07:03.965 --> 07:06.884
<i>I didn't want to make this a big deal.</i>

07:15.393 --> 07:19.272
<i>This smell… It's not just mold.</i>

07:25.236 --> 07:29.532
<i>A brush with evenly flattened bristles…</i>
<i>As I suspected.</i>

07:30.199 --> 07:33.411
Did the late emperor
have a hobby of painting?

07:35.371 --> 07:38.458
Just once, he painted something for me.

07:39.750 --> 07:42.879
He said it was a secret just between us.

07:42.962 --> 07:46.299
That if anyone found out,
it would be taken away.

07:47.800 --> 07:50.803
<i>Is he getting flustered?</i>
<i>That's Lord Jinshi's habit.</i>

07:51.387 --> 07:54.265
<i>He is pretending to be calm.</i>

07:55.141 --> 07:59.312
<i>I don't know much about</i>
<i>the late emperor, nor do I wish to.</i>

07:59.395 --> 08:02.773
<i>But to uncover the truth</i>
<i>behind this curse, I need evidence.</i>

08:08.112 --> 08:11.282
Did the late emperor
always paint in this room?

08:11.365 --> 08:13.409
I'm not sure about that,

08:13.493 --> 08:16.454
but from the time
he began secluding himself here,

08:16.537 --> 08:18.289
one individual had been accompanying him.

08:18.372 --> 08:20.249
Can you call that person here?

08:20.333 --> 08:23.544
I believe they still work here.

08:23.628 --> 08:24.795
I'll call them.

08:28.132 --> 08:29.509
May I touch it?

08:29.592 --> 08:30.593
Go ahead.

08:34.096 --> 08:35.932
<i>It's stiffer than I expected.</i>

08:36.807 --> 08:38.851
<i>And it has a distinct smell.</i>

08:39.852 --> 08:42.063
<i>There are translucent fragments</i>
<i>on the floor.</i>

08:42.146 --> 08:45.274
<i>And stains that look like someone</i>
<i>tried desperately to wipe them away.</i>

08:45.358 --> 08:47.276
<i>And those stains…</i>

08:47.360 --> 08:49.779
<i>They increase the closer</i>
<i>you get to the wall.</i>

08:54.158 --> 08:58.204
<i>It's soft. Layers of thick paper</i>
<i>seem to be pasted here.</i>

08:59.288 --> 09:02.750
<i>It's coated,</i>
<i>perhaps to reinforce the surface.</i>

09:03.376 --> 09:06.212
<i>I had a general idea about the curse,</i>

09:06.295 --> 09:09.298
<i>but now, I might uncover something</i>
<i>seemingly insignificant as well.</i>

09:09.840 --> 09:11.217
I've brought them here.

09:13.302 --> 09:14.220
You are…?

09:18.724 --> 09:23.604
<i>He seem quite old for someone entrusted</i>
<i>with the room of a person of high status…</i>

09:24.188 --> 09:25.815
I have something to ask you.

09:27.066 --> 09:29.026
This person is a former slave.

09:29.110 --> 09:30.653
And also, he cannot speak.

09:30.736 --> 09:32.530
I see.

09:32.613 --> 09:33.864
<i>So that's how it is, huh?</i>

09:34.824 --> 09:38.536
<i>It's not uncommon to choose</i>
<i>a servant who cannot speak.</i>

09:39.203 --> 09:43.374
<i>Especially for someone of high status</i>
<i>who is constantly under watch.</i>

09:43.457 --> 09:46.502
Then, just nod or shake your head
and that will be enough.

09:46.586 --> 09:49.297
Were there any paintings in this room?

09:51.173 --> 09:53.175
I believe there was something…

09:54.218 --> 09:57.930
<i>So, he won’t even bother listening</i>
<i>to what a young girl has to say?</i>

09:59.807 --> 10:00.933
<i>No, that's not it.</i>

10:02.018 --> 10:03.894
<i>Is he hiding something?</i>

10:06.814 --> 10:08.274
Is there something on the wall?

10:12.445 --> 10:14.572
May I remove this wallpaper?

10:16.866 --> 10:18.784
<i>It’s as if he's telling me not to.</i>

10:20.161 --> 10:20.995
I don't mind.

10:21.996 --> 10:24.040
It's going to be destroyed anyway.

10:24.582 --> 10:26.709
If it helps to uncover something,
please do it.

10:35.468 --> 10:37.345
Carefully…

10:52.485 --> 10:53.486
This painting…

10:53.569 --> 10:55.196
What is that?

10:55.780 --> 10:57.782
It must have been
painted by the late emperor.

10:58.449 --> 11:01.202
<i>I have no interest</i>
<i>in the emperor's character.</i>

11:01.285 --> 11:03.829
<i>Because he stood</i>
<i>at the pinnacle of the nation,</i>

11:03.913 --> 11:06.707
<i>he likely died without ever being able</i>
<i>to fully utilize his true talent.</i>

11:08.084 --> 11:10.711
<i>That talent resides in this painting.</i>

11:11.712 --> 11:14.507
The color of the robe
this woman is wearing…

11:14.590 --> 11:18.969
I believe it's made from pigment ground
from orpiment stone.

11:21.430 --> 11:24.308
Orpiment shares the same properties
as arsenic.

11:25.017 --> 11:29.188
<i>And arsenic has a preservative effect,</i>
<i>preventing decay.</i>

11:31.732 --> 11:35.486
At first, I thought that the orpiment used
in the wallpaper or something similar

11:35.569 --> 11:38.739
was unknowingly absorbed
into his body over time.

11:38.823 --> 11:40.074
That's what I thought.

11:40.741 --> 11:43.869
But after seeing
the shape of the brush in this room,

11:43.953 --> 11:46.455
another possibility emerged.

11:47.039 --> 11:50.042
He must have been
using pigment made from orpiment.

11:50.876 --> 11:53.087
The arsenic contained in the orpiment

11:53.170 --> 11:57.091
was likely absorbed gradually
into the late emperor's body.

11:57.174 --> 12:01.011
By the time of his death, it must have
spread throughout his entire body.

12:02.596 --> 12:05.057
<i>He continued painting in secret,</i>

12:05.141 --> 12:06.600
<i>right here in this room.</i>

12:07.768 --> 12:11.564
<i>For an emperor to engage in painting, such</i>
<i>a thing would be considered unthinkable.</i>

12:11.647 --> 12:14.066
<i>At least that's how people</i>
<i>around him would see it.</i>

12:14.900 --> 12:17.778
<i>That's why, even if he was called a fool,</i>

12:17.862 --> 12:19.572
<i>the late emperor never made it public.</i>

12:19.655 --> 12:23.617
<i>It was likely for that reason</i>
<i>he entrusted the care of this room</i>

12:23.701 --> 12:25.077
<i>to a mute slave servant.</i>

12:25.661 --> 12:27.288
<i>There's still some resilience left.</i>

12:27.371 --> 12:30.040
<i>Just how many layers lie beneath this?</i>

12:31.167 --> 12:33.127
<i>With so many paintings,</i>

12:33.210 --> 12:35.296
<i>the one who prepared</i>
<i>the materials was likely…</i>

12:36.046 --> 12:37.965
<i>the Empress, the late emperor's mother.</i>

12:38.591 --> 12:40.801
<i>The woman in this painting must have known</i>

12:41.635 --> 12:45.806
<i>that her own child</i>
<i>was not fit to be emperor.</i>

12:46.474 --> 12:50.603
<i>So, to protect her son who had stumbled</i>
<i>upon the imperial throne by chance,</i>

12:50.686 --> 12:52.813
<i>she gathered power under herself.</i>

12:53.397 --> 12:57.318
<i>Even if it meant being called</i>
<i>the Empress in her own right.</i>

12:58.152 --> 13:01.739
<i>The empress,</i>
<i>who did everything for her child,</i>

13:01.822 --> 13:03.324
<i>ultimately granted him this room…</i>

13:03.407 --> 13:04.783
<i>and the tools to paint with.</i>

13:05.701 --> 13:06.744
<i>Unaware they were poisonous.</i>

13:08.829 --> 13:10.623
<i>What an irony.</i>

13:13.000 --> 13:15.002
That is all I can say.

13:16.128 --> 13:18.881
You've done more than enough.

13:31.393 --> 13:36.190
<i>It's as if she's questioning someone</i>
<i>far beyond the azure sky.</i>

13:37.316 --> 13:39.944
<i>How sentimental I've become.</i>

13:52.039 --> 13:54.959
<i>How irritating.</i>

13:59.380 --> 14:01.048
<i>Even though it's faded,</i>

14:01.715 --> 14:04.885
<i>his presence remains overwhelming.</i>

14:06.720 --> 14:09.557
<i>Am I within this painting too?</i>

14:10.474 --> 14:13.060
<i>No, in the end, I am merely…</i>

14:13.727 --> 14:15.896
<i>a fleeting existence passing by.</i>

14:18.148 --> 14:20.693
<i>It is only thanks to the scars left here</i>

14:20.776 --> 14:23.404
<i>that I now stand</i>
<i>as the Mother of the Nation.</i>

14:25.239 --> 14:27.700
<i>By chance,</i>
<i>I fell into the late emperor's hands</i>

14:27.783 --> 14:29.910
<i>and conceived a child.</i>

14:30.661 --> 14:32.746
<i>There were voices that pitied such a girl.</i>

14:33.372 --> 14:35.207
<i>Surely, such girls did exist.</i>

14:36.292 --> 14:40.212
<i>But I had known of</i>
<i>the emperor's perversions from the start.</i>

14:41.255 --> 14:44.800
<i>My father was a civil official,</i>
<i>and my mother, a concubine.</i>

14:44.884 --> 14:49.013
<i>And though my face was youthful,</i>
<i>I matured early.</i>

14:49.680 --> 14:53.225
<i>And my father used me</i>
<i>as a convenient tool.</i>

14:56.896 --> 15:00.149
<i>I entered the rear palace as an attendant</i>
<i>to a mid-ranking consort.</i>

15:00.774 --> 15:03.193
<i>That consort was my half-sister.</i>

15:03.277 --> 15:06.196
<i>She was raised with</i>
<i>the utmost care and affection.</i>

15:06.280 --> 15:09.116
<i>She had no way of knowing</i>
<i>our father's true intentions.</i>

15:09.199 --> 15:12.161
Hey, Anshi! Hurry up
and put on the ornaments for me!

15:12.244 --> 15:14.413
Yes, Sister.

15:17.291 --> 15:20.794
At last, tonight, His Majesty will come…

15:20.878 --> 15:22.963
I caught a glimpse of him
from afar the other day…

15:23.547 --> 15:25.841
He was truly a beautiful man.

15:26.634 --> 15:27.968
Is that so?

15:30.596 --> 15:32.222
We have been expecting you.

15:39.563 --> 15:42.358
Please, come in.

15:43.400 --> 15:44.985
Get away!

15:47.446 --> 15:48.572
Emperor!

15:54.995 --> 15:56.205
<i>That figure…</i>

15:56.288 --> 15:59.959
<i>hardly seemed worthy of</i>
<i>standing atop the nation.</i>

16:00.542 --> 16:02.711
<i>As an attendant, I should have</i>
<i>either comforted the consort</i>

16:02.795 --> 16:06.215
<i>or apologized for</i>
<i>any disrespect toward the Emperor.</i>

16:06.924 --> 16:07.800
<i>Yet…</i>

16:21.689 --> 16:23.524
Are you alright?

16:27.653 --> 16:28.779
<i>The Emperor's eyes…</i>

16:29.738 --> 16:32.116
<i>certainly caught sight of me.</i>

16:32.741 --> 16:36.328
<i>The eyes of a girl brimming with ambition.</i>

16:42.543 --> 16:44.920
<i>I bore the late Emperor's child</i>

16:45.004 --> 16:47.756
<i>and faced death's shadow countless times.</i>

16:47.840 --> 16:50.259
<i>I was fortunate that my child was a boy,</i>

16:50.342 --> 16:53.554
<i>and the Empress acknowledged</i>
<i>the child as her grandson.</i>

16:55.264 --> 16:56.557
"There, there…"

16:56.640 --> 16:58.142
"Yes, yes."

17:00.811 --> 17:03.147
<i>There was once a woman</i>
<i>who bore a daughter.</i>

17:03.772 --> 17:06.525
<i>She claimed the girl was</i>
<i>the late Emperor's child,</i>

17:06.608 --> 17:08.527
<i>but the Emperor denied</i>
<i>any knowledge of her.</i>

17:08.610 --> 17:10.738
<i>The medical officer accused of</i>
<i>being the father,</i>

17:10.821 --> 17:12.906
<i>was exiled along with the child.</i>

17:13.782 --> 17:17.953
<i>At that time, only medical officers were</i>
<i>spared from castration in the rear palace.</i>

17:18.037 --> 17:21.415
<i>But from then on,</i>
<i>even they were forced to undergo it.</i>

17:22.082 --> 17:24.918
The one who performed
surgery on my abdomen…

17:25.002 --> 17:27.421
<i>How pitiful that</i>
<i>such cruel misfortune befell him.</i>

17:28.380 --> 17:32.843
<i>The woman who gave birth to a daughter</i>
<i>remained alone in the rear palace.</i>

17:33.510 --> 17:36.430
<i>She would never leave the palace</i>
<i>for the rest of her life.</i>

17:37.389 --> 17:39.808
<i>Time passed even further…</i>

17:41.018 --> 17:43.729
<i>When I no longer appeared as a young girl,</i>

17:43.812 --> 17:45.939
<i>the late Emperor never came to see me.</i>

17:46.815 --> 17:49.610
It seems the court ranks
will expand again.

17:49.693 --> 17:52.821
Yes. I heard that Lord Shishou
proposed it.

17:53.864 --> 17:54.698
I see.

17:54.782 --> 17:57.618
<i>The rear palace kept growing larger,</i>

17:57.701 --> 18:00.996
<i>and young girls burdened</i>
<i>with the same fate as mine</i>

18:01.080 --> 18:02.456
<i>kept arriving, one after another.</i>

18:14.676 --> 18:18.138
<i>Existing solely</i>
<i>as a puppet of the Empress,</i>

18:18.222 --> 18:21.683
<i>he was a pathetic man who could only</i>

18:21.767 --> 18:23.936
<i>converse properly with young girls.</i>

18:38.408 --> 18:41.328
<i>To be forgotten by someone like that…</i>

18:41.411 --> 18:42.830
<i>I couldn't forgive him!</i>

18:46.333 --> 18:48.085
Are you afraid of me?

18:50.921 --> 18:53.298
Is it because I've become a grown woman?

18:54.508 --> 18:55.342
Or is it…

18:55.425 --> 18:57.970
this scar on my stomach?

18:58.762 --> 19:03.142
<i>I tormented the man who trembled,</i>
<i>begging for forgiveness in the bedchamber.</i>

19:03.934 --> 19:07.020
<i>The young girls who had</i>
<i>been touched by him.</i>

19:07.729 --> 19:09.648
<i>And his great mother, the Empress.</i>

19:10.774 --> 19:13.152
<i>I wanted to imprint memories of myself</i>
<i>onto him more than them.</i>

19:14.778 --> 19:16.155
<i>After that, the late emperor</i>

19:16.822 --> 19:19.825
<i>broke his spirit,</i>
<i>and withdrew into that room.</i>

19:19.908 --> 19:22.911
<i>No one felt the urge</i>
<i>to question the reason.</i>

19:25.706 --> 19:27.249
<i>In the end,</i>

19:27.332 --> 19:30.460
<i>that man probably only</i>
<i>pictured the Empress, his mother,</i>

19:30.544 --> 19:34.339
<i>and those ambitionless daughters</i>
<i>in these pictures.</i>

19:37.176 --> 19:38.552
<i>Just once,</i>

19:39.136 --> 19:40.554
<i>he painted me.</i>

19:41.930 --> 19:43.432
<i>Even though</i>

19:43.515 --> 19:45.809
<i>I once cherished that painting dearly,</i>

19:45.893 --> 19:47.769
<i>I told Suiren to throw it away.</i>

19:48.353 --> 19:49.813
<i>"I don't need it," I said.</i>

19:50.731 --> 19:53.650
<i>Just as I wasn't needed by him.</i>

20:01.909 --> 20:05.871
Long ago, the late emperor
once came to see us, didn't he?

20:06.455 --> 20:09.374
Yes, I wonder how many years ago that was.

20:10.083 --> 20:12.836
At that time,
I picked up something like this.

20:13.629 --> 20:15.464
They say this is orpiment.

20:16.465 --> 20:17.841
This stone…

20:18.717 --> 20:21.595
This morning,
Suiren finally returned it to me.

20:23.430 --> 20:24.264
I see…

20:29.561 --> 20:31.605
<i>Even if they call it</i>
<i>an illegitimate child,</i>

20:31.688 --> 20:33.857
<i>or say it was a child switched at birth,</i>

20:33.941 --> 20:36.526
<i>there's no doubt</i>
<i>it's still a precious child.</i>

20:36.610 --> 20:39.988
Once, I think I saw one of his paintings.

20:40.572 --> 20:44.493
<i>It was softly-colored,</i>
<i>depicting a young girl.</i>

20:45.452 --> 20:48.997
I must have picked up this stone
because I remembered that painting.

20:49.748 --> 20:51.917
<i>Even though I said to throw it away.</i>

20:52.542 --> 20:56.421
In the past, you used to like
wearing this color, didn't you?

21:16.692 --> 21:17.526
It's just a coincidence.

21:18.652 --> 21:21.947
Is the woman in that painting
really the Empress?

21:23.073 --> 21:26.910
What was he trying to convey back then?

21:32.582 --> 21:33.750
I don't know.

21:36.962 --> 21:39.381
<i>I chose not to find out.</i>

21:40.173 --> 21:42.050
More importantly, you…

21:42.134 --> 21:45.137
It seems you've taken quite
an interest in an intriguing attendant.

21:47.389 --> 21:49.558
She's quite useful.

21:50.350 --> 21:52.352
Indeed. But…

21:53.854 --> 21:56.356
<i>I know that's not all there is to it.</i>

22:01.862 --> 22:04.072
<i>I've been watching you for years.</i>

22:07.409 --> 22:10.078
If you don't keep your favorites hidden,

22:10.912 --> 22:13.206
someone will hide them from you.

23:46.133 --> 23:49.427
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.310 --> 24:00.063
<i>The next episode is "Ghost Stories."</i>

24:00.147 --> 24:00.981
